        </h3>
        <div><img src="<%=Application("img_path_russel")%>/m_russel/intro/2024/medical/cont01_img.jpg" alt="" /></div>
        <!-- 모집요강 및 장학혜택 -->
        <h2 class="mt60">2025 메디컬 전문반<br>
        <strong>모집요강 및 장학혜택</strong></h2>
        <div class="tbl-tab-wrap">
            <div class="bt-wrap">
